"我太高兴了，都哭了……\p"
"我马上去登记。\n"
"请不要走开哦！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:362
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice1Reject"
