"Oh, b-but…\n"
"Sob… Waaaaah!$"
msgstr ""
"啊，可、可是……\n"
"呜……哇啊啊啊！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:366
