#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:428
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice4Accept"
msgid ""
"Really? I can't believe it!\n"
"I can't believe you'll let me join you!\l"
