"我就知道我不够格……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:439
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice5Intro"
msgid ""
"Hi, I'm {STR_VAR_3}.\n"
"I'm {STR_VAR_1}'s no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice!$"
