"组成这样的队伍会很好：\l"
"会{STR_VAR_1}的{STR_VAR_2}$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:448
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice5Mon2Ask"
msgid ""
"and one {STR_VAR_2} that knows how\n"
"to use {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"Not bad, huh?\n"
"Want me to team up with you?$"
msgstr ""
"和会使用{STR_VAR_1}的\n"
"{STR_VAR_2}。\p"
"还不错吧？\n"
"要我和你组队吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:454
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice5Accept"
msgid ""
"Okay, glad to join you!\n"
"I hope you won't mess things up for me!\l"
"I'll do my registration now.$"
msgstr ""
"好，很高兴和你组队！\n"
"希望你别拖我后腿哦！\l"
"我这就去登记。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:459
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice5Reject"
msgid ""
"Huh? Why did you turn me down?\n"
"You're no judge of character!$"
msgstr ""
"咦？你为什么拒绝我？\n"
"你真是不识货！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:463
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice6Intro"
msgid ""
"I'm {STR_VAR_3} and I'm a TRIATHLETE.\n"
"I'm busy every day what with jogging,\l"
"training, and rapping.\p"
"I also happen to be {STR_VAR_1}'s\n"
"no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice.$"
msgstr ""
"我是{STR_VAR_3}，是铁人三项选手。\n"
"每天忙着慢跑、训练\l"
"还有说唱。\p"
"另外，我也是{STR_VAR_1}的\n"
"第{STR_VAR_2}号徒弟。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:470
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice6Mon1"
msgid ""
"This is what {STR_VAR_3} recommended.\n"
"One {STR_VAR_1}-using {STR_VAR_2}$"
msgstr ""
"这是{STR_VAR_3}推荐的。\n"
"会{STR_VAR_1}的{STR_VAR_2}$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:474
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice6Mon2Ask"
msgid ""
"and one {STR_VAR_1}-using\n"
"{STR_VAR_2}.\p"
"I put a lot of effort into raising\n"
"them, even though I'm busy.\p"
"Let's form a tag team\n"
"and give it a go!$"
msgstr ""
"和会{STR_VAR_1}的\n"
"{STR_VAR_2}。\p"
"虽然我很忙，\n"
"但培育它们花了很多心血。\p"
"我们组队\n"
"试一试吧！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:482
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice6Accept"
msgid ""
"Thanks, that's the spirit!\n"
"Hang tight while I go register, okay?$"
msgstr ""
"谢啦，就是要这股劲！\n"
"我去登记，稍等一下哦？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:486
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice6Reject"
msgid ""
"I took time from my busy schedule\n"
"to be here! Give me a break!$"
msgstr ""
"我可是在百忙之中抽空来的！\n"
"饶了我吧！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:490
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice7Intro"
msgid ""
"Hi!\n"
"How's it going?\p"
"I'm {STR_VAR_3}, {STR_VAR_1}'s\n"
"no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice. Glad to meet you!$"
msgstr ""
"嗨！\n"
"最近怎么样？\p"
"我是{STR_VAR_3}，是{STR_VAR_1}的\n"
"第{STR_VAR_2}号徒弟。很高兴认识你！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:496
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice7Mon1"
msgid ""
"Listen, listen! You have to hear about\n"
"the POKéMON {STR_VAR_3} recommended.\l"
"One {STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1} and$"
msgstr ""
"听我说，听我说！你一定要听听\n"
"{STR_VAR_3}推荐的宝可梦。\l"
"会{STR_VAR_1}的{STR_VAR_2}和$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:501
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice7Mon2Ask"
msgid ""
"one {STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1}.\n"
"Of course I raised them superbly!\p"
"So, want to team up?\n"
"I'm sure it'll be a great combo!$"
msgstr ""
"会{STR_VAR_1}的{STR_VAR_2}。\n"
"当然，我把它们培育得超棒！\p"
