"肯定会是个很棒的组合！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:507
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice7Accept"
msgid ""
"Yay, I think this will be fun!\n"
"I'll go register!$"
msgstr ""
"耶，我觉得一定会很好玩！\n"
"我去登记了！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:511
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice7Reject"
msgid ""
"Oh, you're mean!\n"
"I come recommended, you know.$"
msgstr ""
"哼，你真坏！\n"
"我可是被推荐来的哦。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:515
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice8Intro"
msgid ""
"Please let me introduce myself.\n"
"I am {STR_VAR_3}.\p"
"I serve as {STR_VAR_1}'s\n"
"no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice.$"
msgstr ""
"请允许我自我介绍。\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_3}。\p"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}的\n"
"第{STR_VAR_2}号徒弟。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:521
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice8Mon1"
msgid ""
"I sought the sage advice of\n"
"{STR_VAR_3} and raised my team\l"
"of one {STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1}$"
msgstr ""
"我听取了{STR_VAR_3}的高见，\n"
"培育了我的队伍：\l"
"会{STR_VAR_1}的{STR_VAR_2}$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:526
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice8Mon2Ask"
msgid ""
"and one {STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"Please agree to a tag team with me!$"
msgstr ""
"和会{STR_VAR_1}的{STR_VAR_2}。\p"
"请答应和我组队吧！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:530
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice8Accept"
msgid ""
"Oh… I'm delighted!\n"
"I promise to give you my best!\p"
"Of course I will register us!\n"
"Please wait!$"
msgstr ""
"啊……我太高兴了！\n"
"我保证会全力以赴！\p"
"登记就交给我吧！\n"
"请稍候！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:536
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice8Reject"
msgid ""
"I had been hoping to join you,\n"
"{PLAYER}…$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}，\n"
"我一直希望能和你组队的……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:540
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice9Intro"
msgid ""
"Eek! You spoke to me!\n"
"I… I'm overjoyed!\p"
"I'm {STR_VAR_3}! I'm {STR_VAR_1}'s\n"
"no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice!$"
msgstr ""
"呀！你跟我说话了！\n"
"我……我太开心了！\p"
"我是{STR_VAR_3}！我是{STR_VAR_1}的\n"
"第{STR_VAR_2}号徒弟！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:546
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice9Mon1"
msgid ""
"On {STR_VAR_3}'s advice, I trained\n"
"one {STR_VAR_1}-using {STR_VAR_2}$"
msgstr ""
"听了{STR_VAR_3}的建议，我培育了\n"
"会{STR_VAR_1}的{STR_VAR_2}$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:550
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice9Mon2Ask"
msgid ""
"and one {STR_VAR_1}-using\n"
"{STR_VAR_2}.\p"
"Please, can you grant me my wish?\n"
"I want to be your tag-team partner!$"
msgstr ""
"和会{STR_VAR_1}的\n"
"{STR_VAR_2}。\p"
"求求你，能满足我的心愿吗？\n"
"我想成为你的搭档！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:556
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice9Accept"
msgid ""
"Eek! I… I feel giddy!\n"
"Thank you so much!\l"
"I'll go register us right away!$"
msgstr ""
"呀！我……我晕乎乎的！\n"
"真是太感谢你了！\l"
"我马上去登记！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:561
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice9Reject"
msgid ""
"Waaah! Don't you feel any pity?\n"
"But that makes you cooler…$"
msgstr ""
"哇啊！你一点同情心都没有吗？\n"
"不过这样反而更酷了……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:565
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice10Intro"
msgid ""
"Yeehaw! I'm {STR_VAR_1}'s\n"
"no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice!\p"
"{STR_VAR_3}'s my name, hello, hello!$"
msgstr ""
"呀呼！我是{STR_VAR_1}的\n"
"第{STR_VAR_2}号徒弟！\p"
"我叫{STR_VAR_3}，你好，你好！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:570
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice10Mon1"
msgid ""
"My mentor {STR_VAR_3} recommended\n"
"one {STR_VAR_1}-master {STR_VAR_2}$"
msgstr ""
"我的师父{STR_VAR_3}推荐了\n"
"精通{STR_VAR_1}的{STR_VAR_2}$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:574
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice10Mon2Ask"
msgid ""
"and one {STR_VAR_1}-master\n"
"{STR_VAR_2}.\p"
"Good stuff, huh?\n"
"You'll partner with me, won't you?$"
msgstr ""
"和精通{STR_VAR_1}的\n"
"{STR_VAR_2}。\p"
"很棒吧？\n"
"你会和我搭档的，对吧？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:580
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice10Accept"
msgid ""
"Okay, excellent!\n"
"I'll get the registration done quickly!$"
msgstr ""
"好，太好了！\n"
"我马上把登记办好！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:584
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice10Reject"
msgid ""
"Gwaaah!\n"
"You're a calculating one, {PLAYER}!$"
msgstr ""
"呜哇！\n"
"{PLAYER}，你真会算计！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:588
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice11Intro"
msgid ""
"Hey! There's big trouble! This is\n"
"the BATTLE TOWER's last day!\p"
"… … … … … …\n"
"I'm only joking!\p"
"People call me {STR_VAR_3} and I do, too!\n"
"I'm {STR_VAR_1}'s 1,000th apprentice!\l"
"Actually, I'm no. {STR_VAR_2}!$"
msgstr ""
"喂！出大事了！\n"
"今天是对战塔的最后一天！\p"
"…… …… …… …… …… ……\n"
"开玩笑的啦！\p"
"大家都叫我{STR_VAR_3}，我自己也是！\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}的第1000号徒弟！\l"
"其实是第{STR_VAR_2}号啦！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:597
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice11Mon1"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_3} gave me some advice.\n"
"{STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1} and$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_3}给了我一些建议。\n"
"会{STR_VAR_1}的{STR_VAR_2}和$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:601
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice11Mon2Ask"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1}.\n"
"I've got ten of each kind!\l"
"Actually, just one of each!\p"
"How about it?\n"
"Want to try tag battles with me?$"
msgstr ""
"会{STR_VAR_1}的{STR_VAR_2}。\n"
"每种我都有10只！\l"
"其实每种只有1只啦！\p"
"怎么样？\n"
"要和我一起试试搭档对战吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:608
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice11Accept"
msgid ""
"Yippee!\n"
"I'll give you a POKéMON as my thanks!\p"
"Just joking! But I will really go do\n"
"the registration, okay?$"
msgstr ""
"耶！\n"
"作为谢礼，我送你一只宝可梦！\p"
"开玩笑的！不过我是真的\n"
"要去登记了哦？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:614
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice11Reject"
msgid ""
"Oh, that's so cold! I'll have to wreck\n"
"the BATTLE TOWER for that!\p"
"Of course I won't!$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀，好冷淡！\n"
"那我只好把对战塔拆了！\p"
"当然是骗你的啦！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:619
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice12Intro"
msgid ""
"Hey, there, I'm rockin' and a-rollin'!\n"
"POKéMON, I be controllin'!\p"
"I'm {STR_VAR_3} the rappin' SAILOR.\n"
"Don't be mistakin' me for no wailer!\p"
"I'm {STR_VAR_1}'s no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice.\n"
"Me, you shouldn't be quick to dismiss!$"
msgstr ""
"嘿，我摇滚又欢唱！\n"
"宝可梦，我来掌！\p"
"我是说唱水手{STR_VAR_3}。\n"
"可别把我当成爱哭虫！\p"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}的第{STR_VAR_2}号徒弟。\n"
"可别随便把我小看！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:627
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice12Mon1"
msgid ""
"With the advice of {STR_VAR_3} I did\n"
"abide, put together my team of pride!\l"
"One {STR_VAR_1}-using {STR_VAR_2}$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_3}的建议我照办，\n"
"组成骄傲的队伍来登场！\l"
"会{STR_VAR_1}的{STR_VAR_2}$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:632
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice12Mon2Ask"
msgid ""
"and one {STR_VAR_1}-using\n"
"{STR_VAR_2}!\p"
"Our meeting we should commemorate,\n"
"with a tag-team victory to celebrate!$"
msgstr ""
"和会{STR_VAR_1}的\n"
"{STR_VAR_2}！\p"
"我们的相遇值得纪念，\n"
"用搭档的胜利来庆祝一番！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:638
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice12Accept"
msgid ""
"Hey, hey, I like your style!\n"
"Our registration, I will go file!$"
msgstr ""
"嘿嘿，我喜欢你的风格！\n"
"登记手续，我去办妥！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:642
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice12Reject"
msgid ""
"Oh, hey, {PLAYER}, now that's cold!\n"
"If I may be so bold!$"
msgstr ""
"哎，{PLAYER}，你真冷淡！\n"
"恕我直言，太不应该！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:646
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice13Intro"
msgid ""
"Yippee-yahoo!\n"
"Oh, don't run! I was just having fun!\p"
"Howdy! I'm {STR_VAR_3}!\n"
"I'm {STR_VAR_1}'s no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice!$"
msgstr ""
"呀呼呀呼！\n"
"哎，别跑！我只是闹着玩！\p"
"你好！我是{STR_VAR_3}！\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}的第{STR_VAR_2}号徒弟！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:652
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice13Mon1"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_3} told me what to do.\n"
"So one {STR_VAR_1}-using {STR_VAR_2}$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_3}告诉我该怎么做。\n"
"所以，会{STR_VAR_1}的{STR_VAR_2}$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:656
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice13Mon2Ask"
msgid ""
"and one {STR_VAR_1}-using\n"
"{STR_VAR_2}, I did choose.\p"
"So, what do you say?\n"
"Come on, make my day!\p"
"Please, I'm begging you!\n"
"Let me join you, don't leave me blue!$"
msgstr ""
"和会{STR_VAR_1}的\n"
"{STR_VAR_2}，就是我的选择。\p"
"那么，你觉得怎样？\n"
"来吧，让我开心一下！\p"
"求求你了！\n"
"让我加入吧，别让我难过！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:664
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice13Accept"
msgid ""
"Yeahah! Luck is with me!\n"
"It sure makes me happy!\p"
"Before we go join the fray,\n"
"I'll go register right away!$"
msgstr ""
"耶哈！幸运女神眷顾我！\n"
"真让我高兴得不得了！\p"
"在我们投入战斗之前，\n"
"我马上就去登记一下！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:670
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice13Reject"
msgid ""
"You're turning me down?\n"
"{PLAYER}, you're making me frown!$"
msgstr ""
"你要拒绝我？\n"
"{PLAYER}，你让我好失落！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:674
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice14Intro"
msgid ""
"Cough!\p"
"Oh, sorry, I have a cold.\n"
"My POKéMON are fine, though.\p"
"My name's {STR_VAR_3}, {STR_VAR_1}'s\n"
"no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice. Cough!$"
msgstr ""
"咳咳！\p"
"啊，抱歉，我感冒了。\n"
"不过我的宝可梦都很好。\p"
"我叫{STR_VAR_3}，是{STR_VAR_1}的\n"
"第{STR_VAR_2}号徒弟。咳咳！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:681
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice14Mon1"
msgid ""
"I took {STR_VAR_3}'s advice to heart\n"
"and put together my team of\l"
"one {STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1} and$"
msgstr ""
"我把{STR_VAR_3}的建议牢记在心，\n"
"组成了我的队伍：\l"
"会{STR_VAR_1}的{STR_VAR_2}和$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:686
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice14Mon2Ask"
msgid ""
"one {STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"I trained them every day,\n"
"even in wind and rain.\p"
"That's why I have this cold,\n"
"I think.\p"
"That's what I'm about.\n"
"Want to be my tag partner?$"
msgstr ""
"会{STR_VAR_1}的{STR_VAR_2}。\p"
"我每天都训练它们，\n"
"风雨无阻。\p"
"我想，我就是因为这样\n"
"才感冒的吧。\p"
"我就是这样的人。\n"
"要做我的搭档吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:695
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice14Accept"
msgid ""
"Thanks, I appreciate this!\n"
"Cough, cough!\l"
"Hang on while I go register.$"
msgstr ""
"谢谢，太感激了！\n"
"咳咳，咳咳！\l"
"我去登记，稍等一下。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:700
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice14Reject"
msgid ""
"Oh, you won't?\n"
"{PLAYER}, I think we'd make a good pair.$"
msgstr ""
"哦，你不愿意吗？\n"
"{PLAYER}，我觉得我们会是好搭档的。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:704
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice15Intro"
msgid ""
"Oh, hello!\n"
"This is nerve-racking.\p"
"I'm {STR_VAR_3}.\n"
"I'm the no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice of {STR_VAR_1}.$"
msgstr ""
"啊，你好！\n"
"好紧张啊。\p"
"我是{STR_VAR_3}。\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}的第{STR_VAR_2}号徒弟。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:710
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice15Mon1"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_3} said this team'll be good--\n"
"one {STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1} and$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_3}说这样的队伍会很好——\n"
"会{STR_VAR_1}的{STR_VAR_2}和$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:714
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice15Mon2Ask"
msgid ""
"one {STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"I'm feeling self-conscious about this,\n"
"but will you let me join you?$"
msgstr ""
"会{STR_VAR_1}的{STR_VAR_2}。\p"
"虽然我有点不好意思，\n"
"但你愿意让我加入吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:719
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice15Accept"
msgid ""
"Oh, gee, thank you!\n"
"I feel bashful, but I'll do my best!\p"
"I'll go get the registration done.$"
msgstr ""
"啊，哇，谢谢你！\n"
"虽然有点害羞，但我会努力的！\p"
"我去把登记办好。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:724
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice15Reject"
msgid ""
"Oh, please don't say no!\n"
"I feel self-conscious enough already…$"
msgstr ""
"啊，请不要拒绝我！\n"
"我已经够不好意思的了……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:728
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice16Intro"
msgid ""
"I am {STR_VAR_3}, and that's no lie.\n"
"I am {STR_VAR_1}'s no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice.$"
msgstr ""
"我是{STR_VAR_3}，这可不是骗人的。\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}的第{STR_VAR_2}号徒弟。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:732
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice16Mon1"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_3} recommended my team.\p"
"Since the advice sounded sincere,\n"
"I decided to bring with me\l"
"my {STR_VAR_1}-using {STR_VAR_2} and$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_3}推荐了我的队伍。\p"
"因为那建议听起来很真诚，\n"
"我就决定带上\l"
"我会{STR_VAR_1}的{STR_VAR_2}和$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:738
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice16Mon2Ask"
msgid ""
"my {STR_VAR_1}-using {STR_VAR_2}.\p"
"If possible, I would like you to accept\n"
"me as your tag-team partner.$"
msgstr ""
"我会{STR_VAR_1}的{STR_VAR_2}。\p"
"如果可以的话，\n"
"我希望你能接受我做你的搭档。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:743
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice16Accept"
msgid ""
"You really will accept me?\n"
"It would be too terrible otherwise.\p"
"But since you've agreed, this is fine.\n"
"I shall go register the both of us.$"
msgstr ""
"你真的愿意接受我？\n"
"要不然就太糟糕了。\p"
"不过既然你同意了，那就好。\n"
"我去为我们两人登记。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:749
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_Apprentice16Reject"
msgid ""
"Hm? Now why would you refuse?\n"
"Is this your idea of a joke?$"
msgstr ""
"嗯？你为什么要拒绝？\n"
"这是你开的玩笑吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:753
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_LassIntro"
msgid "I'm {STR_VAR_1}, and I'm a LASS!$"
msgstr "我是{STR_VAR_1}，是个迷你裙！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:756
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_LassMon1"
msgid ""
"What I have are one {STR_VAR_2}\n"
"that uses {STR_VAR_1} and one$"
msgstr ""
"我带着会{STR_VAR_1}的\n"
"{STR_VAR_2}和$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:760
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_LassMon2Ask"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_2} that uses {STR_VAR_1}.\n"
"Those are what I have with me.\p"
"Will you be my partner?$"
msgstr ""
"会{STR_VAR_1}的{STR_VAR_2}。\n"
"这就是我带的宝可梦。\p"
"你愿意做我的搭档吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:765
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_Text_LassAccept"
msgid ""
"Thank you!\n"
"I'll go do the registration!$"
msgstr ""
"谢谢你！\n"
"我去登记！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:769
